[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1200.15, "timestamp": "00:20:00", "text": "关注之类的，或者YouTuber，随便哪个都行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1203.35, "timestamp": "00:20:03", "text": "如果您想要……，请告知您所在的平台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1205.83, "timestamp": "00:20:05", "text": "甚至与那位评级主播互动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1209.549, "timestamp": "00:20:09", "text": "等等等等，你只会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1213.31, "timestamp": "00:20:13", "text": "有兴趣的话就参与吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1216.39, "timestamp": "00:20:16", "text": "不，我觉得，嗯，这个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1219.549, "timestamp": "00:20:19", "text": "值得支持。所以，我会给出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1223.35, "timestamp": "00:20:23", "text": "支持。我的主播尝试支持"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1226.669, "timestamp": "00:20:26", "text": "这位主播。你是一名主播。我作为一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1229.27, "timestamp": "00:20:29", "text": "观众想支持我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1231.59, "timestamp": "00:20:31", "text": "主播决定支持这一决定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1233.59, "timestamp": "00:20:33", "text": "我觉得他们值得拥有这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1236.23, "timestamp": "00:20:36", "text": "然后他们都跟着看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1239.19, "timestamp": "00:20:39", "text": "然后，他们的观众就会看到这些内容等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1241.11, "timestamp": "00:20:41", "text": "同一个观众会同时观看这两个节目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1243.909, "timestamp": "00:20:43", "text": "频道之类的东西，对吧？普通的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1248.019, "timestamp": "00:20:48", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "exactly! but there are too many immature ppl out there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1248.789, "timestamp": "00:20:48", "text": "是VR之类的东西吧？得到它？但这是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1252.909, "timestamp": "00:20:52", "text": "这种存在方式，嗯，该怎么称呼呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1256.71, "timestamp": "00:20:56", "text": "它？更像是很常见，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1259.59, "timestamp": "00:20:59", "text": "这意味着它在水疗中心更常见。"}]